# Astro

Follow [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md) and [docs/design-tokens.md](docs/design-tokens.md).

Fetch pages, menus, and site settings through `astro/src/lib/wp/client.ts`. Do not call WordPress from a component with a one-off URL. Brand colours are `var(--color-*)` plus a slug. `colorSlug()` accepts a legacy slug, a `var(--color-…)` string, and `{ slug }`. Text-colour classes are added to the root element of `innerHTML` from `attrs`, not parsed out of saved HTML with a brittle replace.
